;; mac-osx-midnight-50 — Midnight's deep-blue palette with surfaces at 50% RGB
;;
;; Text, accents, focus indicators, and semantic colors retain Midnight's
;; original intensity so the darker canvas remains legible. Backgrounds,
;; panels, and passive surfaces use half of Midnight's RGB values.
;; Every registered theme slot is explicit so this theme never inherits stale
;; colors from the previously active theme.

